notes = "(!) FMT_SYS.ROM (md5): feaf8c5675151e00cfe3ad27673bff29|(!) FMT_DOS.ROM (md5): 0585b19930d4a7f4c71bcc8a33746588|(!) FMT_FNT.ROM (md5): eb44f2093f51eb7159f03e170b13af76|(!) FMT_DIC.ROM (md5): 34847786d7de94b5d1133c956ab1d75d|These are the FM Towns Model 1/2 ROMs; lowercase names (fmt_sys.rom...) are also accepted.|Place the ROMs in system/geartowns/; a complete set in system/ is used as a fallback.|ROM sets from later models load with a warning.|FMT_F20.ROM is optional; a blank ROM is used if it is missing.|Free FM Towns Project replacement ROMs are also supported."

description = "A port of the Geartowns Fujitsu FM Towns emulator to libretro. This core emulates the FM Towns Model 1/2 with CD-ROM and floppy disk drives, disc swapping, gamepads, mouse and keyboard."
